 "notes": [
  "No open-source voice is included. Meta's MMS-TTS publishes no model for this language. The one open South African multi-language model (South-African-TTS-11-Vits, non-commercial licence) is access-restricted: on 13 October our Hugging Face account was not on its access list, and we did not request access.",
